> Regulatory Code: Update RegulatoryAuthorityId with the respective IDs and download the results

> Assessment Indicator Definition: 

-Insert the Assessment Indicator Definition_Updated csv without any changes and download the results

> Regulatory Code Assessment Indicator: Copy Regulatory code Id, Assessment Ind Definition Id from previous results and paste/replace in column A and column B and now save the csv and import the csv

> Assessment Task Definition: Insert the csv without any changes and download the results

> Assessment Task Indicator Definition: Be careful while inserting these records

- Go to “column B - AssessmentIndDefinitionId(AID) “ and give  vlookup (=vlookup(D2,H:I,2,FALSE)) vlookup expansion in D2 = ExternalId of AID and H:I are external id’s and salesforce Id’s of records inserted for AID and enter and drag / drop the records to bottom . similary for column C

- Go to “column C – AssessmentTaskDefinitionId(ATD) “ and give vlookup (=vlookup(E2,L:M,2,FALSE)) vlookup expansion in E2 = ExternalId of ATD and L:M are external id’s and salesforce Id’s of records inserted for ATD and enter and drag / drop the records to bottom)

> Now save the csv and import the csv select all the fields available in the csv provided

> Inspection Types: Insert the csv without any changes

> Assessment Indicator Defined Value:

Replace Id’s of Operational History Assessment-Reportable Incidents , Operational History Assessment-Inspection and follow up, Operational History Assessment-Investigation from Assessment Indicator definition object

